# Testing Discipline (TDD)

## Required Checks

- Run `pnpm test` after ANY change to:
  - Transcription pipeline
  - Audio processing
  - Model configuration
  - Worker communication
- Run `pnpm perf:benchmark` after core pipeline changes

## Test Coverage Requirements

- Critical paths: >= 95% coverage
- New features: tests required before merge
- Bug fixes: regression test required

## No Shipping If

- Any test fails
- Performance regresses > 5% vs baseline
- Flaky tests introduced
- Coverage drops on critical paths

## Test Organization

- Unit tests: `__tests__/unit/`
- Integration tests: `__tests__/integration/`
- Performance tests: `__tests__/perf/` (new)

## Test Patterns

```typescript
// Good: Specific, isolated test
it('should transcribe 30s chunk in under 60s', async () => {
  const result = await transcribe(thirtySecondAudio);
  expect(result.text).toBeTruthy();
  expect(result.duration).toBeLessThan(60000);
});

// Bad: Vague, coupled test
it('should work', async () => {
  const result = await doEverything();
  expect(result).toBeTruthy();
});
```
